@@ -6,3 +6,9 @@ urgent first. This package holds the list itself, in TypeScript; the app's scree
 from `src/index.ts`.
 
 Run its tests with `npm test`.
+
+Every task has an `id`, given by `add` and kept when the task is renamed, so the app can refer to a task
+after its title changes. `get(id)` returns the task with that id, and `find`, `complete`, `reopen`,
+`rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove` take either a title or an id (a title wins over an id written the
+same). Ids are `task-1`, `task-2`, … in the order tasks are added, and are never reused; they are counted
+rather than random so the domain stays deterministic.
